updateBucket.tree
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when bucket index is invalid
    │   └── it should revert with appropriate error
    └── when bucket index is valid
        └── when updating bucket
            ├── it should call _updateBucket internal function
            ├── it should update bucket properties except lockEpochDuration
            ├── it should preserve lockEpochDuration field
            └── it should emit appropriate bucket events 